Build fixes for GCC 15 / Boost >= 1.85 on the dev_27_64 branch, which
upstream mostly builds with MSVC:

- slic3r_orchestrator.h: `= {0}` is valid C but not C++ when the first
  member is an enum; initialize it with the enumerator instead.
- ExtrusionViews.hpp: front()/back()/middle() declare an ExtrusionEntity
  by value inside the ExtrusionEntityReadApi template body, before that
  class is complete; GCC 15 rejects this (-Wtemplate-body). Use auto so
  the type is only needed at instantiation, as the other callers do.
- ConfigDef.hpp: FLT_MAX needs <cfloat>.
- Preset.hpp: lower_bound_by_predicate() lives in ContainerUtils.hpp.
- PluginUpdateDialog.cpp: GUI::format() needs slic3r/GUI/format.hpp.
- RepositoryPackageCache.cpp: boost::filesystem::copy_option was
  removed in Boost 1.85; use copy_options::overwrite_existing.

